findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) counter under soda machine (general buildup);
B) cabinet beneath soda machine  (moisture/debris);
C) steamer - outer surfaces (general buildup);
D) shelving of dirty dish counter at tray return window, inverted tubs, and garbage can lids in the dish room (splash/debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

7400.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) drip tray of stove (food splash);
B) spice racks (general buildup);
C) slicer - general surfaces (food debris);
D) #10 can racks (sugar); and 
E) bulk flour and sugar bins  - outer/general surfaces (powder buildup).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled with grease, general debris, and/or buildup;
A) steamer - 1. base & 2. legs;
B) bottom inside ovens;
C) inside fryer panels (around mechanicals/catch pan below); and
D) underside of prep counter and 2 part sink. 
Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris..
